---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Toolix"
  description="Toolix Terms of Service. Zero-upload client-side utilities."
  canonical="https://toolix.dev/terms"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl py-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6 font-display">Terms of Service</h1>
    <div class="space-y-6 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] font-display">Zero-Upload Policy</h2>
      <p>All data processing is performed client-side using browser-native technologies (Web Workers, WebAssembly, Canvas API, Web Audio API). No files, text inputs, or personal data are transmitted to any server.</p>
      <p>When the browser tab is closed or refreshed, all temporary binary ArrayBuffers and file data are purged from memory.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] font-display">No Sign-Up Requirement</h2>
      <p>Toolix requires no user account, email address, or authentication token. All preferences and streak counters are saved locally in IndexedDB or localStorage.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] font-display">Advertising</h2>
      <p>Display advertising (AdSense or equivalent) is integrated with zero cumulative layout shift (CLS = 0.00). Ad placeholder containers reserve fixed dimensions, preventing content jumps.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] font-display">Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>All source code is proprietary. The word dictionary is derived from publicly available tournament sources (SOWPODS/TWL) and filtered for common gameplay utility.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
